WEBVTT

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:36.870 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.950 line:0%
[Episode 23]

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:41.720 line:0%
Pan?

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.120 line:0%
Why are you here?

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:46.660 line:0%
Secretary Yan.

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:47.650 line:0%
Long time no see.

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:52.680 line:0%
This is a critical investigation area.

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:53.480 line:0%
How can you just let

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:54.880 line:0%
irrelevant people in?

00:01:55.559 --> 00:01:57.360 line:0%
Grand Commander, you have misunderstood.

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:58.120 line:0%
This gentleman

00:01:58.120 --> 00:01:59.480 line:0%
is the top civilian detective,

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:00.680 line:0%
Pan Chi, Mr. Pan.

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:02.640 line:0%
He's here to assist me

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:03.900 line:0%
in the investigation.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:05.930 line:0%
He's not an irrelevant person.

00:02:06.050 --> 00:02:07.310 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:09.400 line:0%
So it's true.

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:11.190 line:0%
The rumors are all true.

00:02:11.220 --> 00:02:13.000 line:0%
Pan is indeed Pan Chi.

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:14.080 line:0%
You can also

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:15.260 line:0%
always think of that Pan

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:16.710 line:0%
as just that Pan.

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.720 line:0%
I also happened to come across this case.

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:21.080 line:0%
I was asked by the suspect's brother-in-law

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:22.280 line:0%
to come and investigate.

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:24.040 line:0%
When the suspect was first arrested,

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:25.440 line:0%
he had nothing on him,

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:26.960 line:0%
and no weapon was found.

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:27.760 line:0%
I suspect

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:29.800 line:0%
he might have been wrongly accused.

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:32.020 line:0%
The case files mentioned

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:33.000 line:0%
that the victim's younger brother

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.120 line:0%
is not trained in martial arts.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:36.780 line:0%
The probability of the brother committing the crime is very low.

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:39.170 line:0%
Based on the situation at the victim's home,

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:41.090 line:0%
it's very likely to be a revenge killing.

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:42.300 line:0%
The elder brother had a bad temper

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:43.800 line:0%
and often had disputes over land issues

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:45.080 line:0%
with the neighbors.

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:46.600 line:0%
He even got into fights

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.440 line:0%
and caused trouble for the village head.

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:49.320 line:0%
In his business,

00:02:49.320 --> 00:02:50.800 line:0%
he also often had conflicts with others.

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:52.400 line:0%
He offended quite a few people.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:53.200 line:0%
It's possible that

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:55.080 line:0%
the killer took this opportunity to murder him

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:57.160 line:0%
and then frame the victim's younger brother.

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:58.730 line:0%
If it's a revenge killing,

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:00.600 line:0%
then the killer and the victim

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:02.240 line:0%
must have had a deep grudge.

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:04.280 line:0%
Just killing would be one thing,

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:05.320 line:0%
but to also take

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:06.000 line:0%
the victim's head away...

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.260 line:0%
Why would they do that?

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:13.580 line:0%
Putting aside the motive,

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:15.130 line:0%
can you two deduce

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:16.800 line:0%
what kind of weapon was used?

00:03:16.879 --> 00:03:18.120 line:0%
Don't rush, Governor Mo.

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:19.740 line:0%
Let us examine it carefully.

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:21.920 line:0%
Let's call it a day.

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:25.760 line:0%
I'm hungry.

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:29.100 line:0%
Governor Mo.

00:03:40.760 --> 00:03:41.820 line:0%
I'll take my leave.

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:52.680 line:0%
[Mortuary]

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:58.000 line:0%
Didn't you say we'd investigate the case first?

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.600 line:0%
Why are you suddenly hungry?

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:01.260 line:0%
Besides,

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:03.240 line:0%
we're not in Xiang'an now.

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:04.000 line:0%
How come you just...

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:05.660 line:0%
Anyway, I'm hungry right now.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:07.760 line:0%
Didn't you say

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:08.960 line:0%
you'd make me some medicinal soup?

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:09.780 line:0%
Where is it?

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:11.890 line:0%
Make medicinal soup?

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:16.270 line:0%
Are you sure you want to use these hands?

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:19.500 line:0%
What's wrong?

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:24.110 line:0%
These hands just examined a corpse.

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.880 line:0%
The medicinal soup made with these hands,

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:28.680 line:0%
are you sure you can eat it?

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:31.470 line:0%
I can eat it.

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:34.940 line:0%
Just wait.

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:55.000 line:0%
That's more like it.

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:56.880 line:0%
Look at him, not even preparing

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:58.140 line:0%
a welcome feast today.

00:04:58.320 --> 00:04:59.520 line:0%
I was worried

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:01.480 line:0%
that this stingy Governor Mo

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:03.040 line:0%
would also mistreat us with the guest rooms.

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:03.760 line:0%
Jing Lin,

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:05.240 line:0%
watch your words.

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:07.440 line:0%
Governor Mo is diligent in his duties and loves the people.

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:08.280 line:0%
He is known among the common people

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:09.610 line:0%
as a rare good official.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.580 line:0%
It's just a welcome feast.

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:13.960 line:0%
Being able to truly serve the people

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:15.420 line:0%
is what's most important.

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:16.840 line:0%
I went to check.

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:19.340 line:0%
Their kitchen here is quite good.

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:20.440 line:0%
As soon as Madam returned,

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:22.640 line:0%
she went to make medicinal soup for you.

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:26.400 line:0%
Help me carry this.

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:27.080 line:0%
Kid.

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:28.430 line:0%
Why is it you?

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:29.920 line:0%
Your mast...

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:33.920 line:0%
Where's your sister?

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:35.240 line:0%
As soon as my sister returned,

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:36.959 line:0%
I pestered her to teach me skills.

00:05:36.959 --> 00:05:38.090 line:0%
She readily agreed,

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:39.560 line:0%
but ended up taking me to the kitchen.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:41.000 line:0%
She taught me how to cook medicinal soup once,

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:42.240 line:0%
then hurriedly left

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:43.700 line:0%
to meet her old friend.

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:45.640 line:0%
leaving me to watch the pot for two hours.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:47.100 line:0%
Her old friend?

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:02.720 line:0%
Young people in the Yingzhou area are accustomed to living on the vast grasslands.

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:05.120 line:0%
They hunt outside the city in fox fur robes.

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:07.950 line:0%
The code is correct.

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:09.720 line:0%
But why is it a male voice?

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:10.760 line:0%
This isn't right.

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:12.850 line:0%
This voice sounds familiar.

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:21.840 line:0%
How...

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:23.790 line:0%
It's you?

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:29.440 line:0%
Young people in the Yingzhou area are accustomed to living on the vast grasslands.

00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:31.840 line:0%
They hunt outside the city in fox fur robes.

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:34.400 line:0%
Even after drinking a thousand cups of wine, they won't get drunk.

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:38.530 line:0%
These children of ethnic minorities can ride horses and run freely at a young age.

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:40.050 line:0%
I am Chi.

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:41.660 line:0%
Pleased to meet you, Xing.

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:52.270 line:0%
Chi?

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:54.980 line:0%
Chi?

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:59.280 line:0%
You're clearly a young gentleman.

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:00.480 line:0%
Why did you lie to me saying you were

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:02.010 line:0%
a young lady from Jiangnan?

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:07.080 line:0%
Actually, I didn't mean to deceive you.

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:07.720 line:0%
It's just that

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:09.000 line:0%
when you first replied,

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:10.730 line:0%
you already called me "young lady."

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:11.460 line:0%
I...

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:15.000 line:0%
Then who told you to use

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.160 line:0%
a woman's floral stationery?

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:17.920 line:0%
The letter is fragrant,

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:19.580 line:0%
with flower petals enclosed.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.030 line:0%
Young Master.

00:07:21.070 --> 00:07:22.960 line:0%
You said you'd write lyrics for my new song.

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:24.400 line:0%
It's been over a month now.

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:26.160 line:0%
When will you write it for me?

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:28.400 line:0%
I'll write.

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:44.750 line:0%
[Chi]

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:48.530 line:0%
Please help me deliver this letter to the Ministry of Justice.

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:49.800 line:0%
Thank you.

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:55.840 line:0%
Director Wu.

00:07:59.150 --> 00:08:00.600 line:0%
These are the letters we received

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:01.320 line:0%
after our public announcement

00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:02.800 line:0%
requesting information on difficult cases

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:03.360 line:0%
a few days ago.

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:04.280 line:0%
I've organized them by region,

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:05.280 line:0%
all sorted out.

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:06.320 line:0%
The one on top is...

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:08.180 line:0%
Throw them away, throw them away.

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:12.390 line:0%
Don't you understand what I'm saying?

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:13.720 line:0%
Throw them away.

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:16.520 line:0%
If you're really that bored,

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:17.580 line:0%
go scrub the floor.

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:24.120 line:0%
[Ministry of Justice Clue Collection Office for Suspected Cases]

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:29.870 line:0%
[Ministry of Justice Clue Collection Office for Suspected Cases]

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:39.729 line:0%
My thoughts on the Ministry of Justice's unsolved cases.

00:08:41.900 --> 00:08:43.170 line:0%
I thought

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:45.950 line:0%
it was some young lady from Jiangnan

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:48.240 line:0%
who, like me, enjoyed analyzing cases.

00:08:48.240 --> 00:08:50.500 line:0%
That's why I sent the first reply letter.

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:52.720 line:0%
This "Chi"

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:55.040 line:0%
was actually a name I came up with casually.

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:56.030 line:0%
This flower

00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:59.690 line:0%
was borrowed from someone else.

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:02.480 line:0%
Then I've been calling you by the wrong gender.

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:03.600 line:0%
Why didn't you correct me

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:04.860 line:0%
in your later replies?

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:06.960 line:0%
Well, I thought about it this way:

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:08.200 line:0%
Since we're pen pals,

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:09.920 line:0%
whether I'm a young gentleman

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:11.160 line:0%
or a young lady,

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:13.160 line:0%
it doesn't affect our friendship through letters,

00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:14.160 line:0%
discussing various topics,

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:15.080 line:0%
and exchanging case information.

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:16.010 line:0%
Don't you agree?

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:18.840 line:0%
You're right.

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:21.320 line:0%
When you put it that way,

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:22.980 line:0%
it does feel more liberating.

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:25.520 line:0%
Oh, right.

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:27.480 line:0%
I didn't know what you liked,

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:29.960 line:0%
so I specifically went to find

00:09:28.820 --> 00:09:31.280 line:0%
[Record of Extraordinary Techniques from the Western Region]

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:31.840 line:0%
a rare copy of "Record of Extraordinary Techniques from the Western Region."

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:32.720 line:0%
In this book,

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:33.840 line:0%
it records

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:35.680 line:0%
the unique tools and techniques from the Western Region.

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:36.480 line:0%
Take a look

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:37.840 line:0%
and see if you like it.

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:43.440 line:0%
Thank you.

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:44.500 line:0%
I like it very much.

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:47.010 line:0%
[Curved Sword]

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:48.230 line:0%
[Curved Sword]

00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:49.600 line:0%
Wait.

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:52.480 line:0%
It's this page.

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:54.840 line:0%
Take a closer look

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:56.100 line:0%
[Curved Sword]

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:56.460 line:0%
at the curved knife on this page.

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:57.660 line:0%
After you left today,

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.600 line:0%
I examined the corpse again.

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:01.480 line:0%
The wound on the headless corpse,

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:02.560 line:0%
judging from the angle of the wound

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:03.920 line:0%
and its smoothness,

00:10:03.920 --> 00:10:05.720 line:0%
it doesn't seem to be caused by a straight blade,

00:10:05.720 --> 00:10:06.740 line:0%
but rather a curved one.

00:10:06.740 --> 00:10:08.240 line:0%
So based on my assessment,

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:09.720 line:0%
the murder weapon

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:10.640 line:0%
should be

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:13.240 line:0%
a specially made curved knife that can cut through iron like mud.

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:14.320 line:0%
I've seen this type of curved knife

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:15.960 line:0%
at the border of Xichen.

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:17.360 line:0%
The curved knife on this page

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:18.240 line:0%
only has slight differences

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:19.500 line:0%
[Curved Sword]

00:10:18.240 --> 00:10:19.560 line:0%
in the blade edge compared to

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:21.120 line:0%
the wound on the victim's neck.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:22.620 line:0%
The structure is almost identical.

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:24.420 line:0%
So whether it's this exact knife

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:27.180 line:0%
still requires further investigation from us.

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:30.000 line:0%
Curved sword from the Western Region?

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:34.240 line:0%
No wonder I've been racking my brains today,

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:35.040 line:0%
but couldn't figure out

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:36.280 line:0%
what weapon was used.

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:37.560 line:0%
It turns out to be something

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:39.120 line:0%
I've never seen before.

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:40.520 line:0%
It seems I really need to

00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:42.360 line:0%
study this book carefully.

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:44.120 line:0%
Learn more about weapons from the Western Region.

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:45.200 line:0%
Maybe I can even find

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:46.260 line:0%
some clues in here.

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:51.170 line:0%
This time I came to Gannan Area,

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:52.880 line:0%
besides investigating the case,

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:55.140 line:0%
there's something even more important.

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:17.080 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:18.400 line:0%
Governor Mo is tired today

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:19.240 line:0%
and has retired early.

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:20.200 line:0%
It's not convenient to meet.

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:22.330 line:0%
You should also go back and rest early.

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:24.640 line:0%
Please convey to Governor Mo

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:27.200 line:0%
that I'll come another day for a good chat.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.080 line:0%
I understand.

00:11:29.280 --> 00:11:30.810 line:0%
This way, Grand Commander.

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:46.200 line:0%
Like a dream, like an immortal, suddenly drifting away.

00:11:46.690 --> 00:11:50.220 line:0%
Where is the evening glow, leaving only the empty green screen?

00:11:58.570 --> 00:11:59.490 line:0%
So,

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:02.470 line:0%
even before the incident in Xiang'an City,

00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:04.440 line:0%
in the hands of human traffickers in Gannan Area,

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:05.680 line:0%
there was already the Fire Moth Jade.

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:06.480 line:0%
That's right.

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:08.000 line:0%
The Fire Moth Sect's infiltration in Gannan Area

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:09.190 line:0%
is deep and far-reaching,

00:12:09.190 --> 00:12:10.790 line:0%
far beyond our imagination.

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:12.640 line:0%
As I've been investigating covertly along the way,

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:14.200 line:0%
I've discovered that many local people

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:16.200 line:0%
secretly follow the Fire Moth Sect.

00:12:17.270 --> 00:12:19.140 line:0%
From Xiang'an to Yingzhou,

00:12:19.520 --> 00:12:20.600 line:0%
I always feel that

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:22.480 line:0%
behind the Fire Moth Sect,

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:24.040 line:0%
there's an invisible hand

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:25.480 line:0%
orchestrating a grand scheme.

00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:27.080 line:0%
Moreover, the person behind this plan

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:29.880 line:0%
must be someone with immense power and influence.

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:31.120 line:0%
I didn't notice

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:32.520 line:0%
we've been talking for so long.

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:33.200 line:0%
It's getting late.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:34.260 line:0%
I should head back.

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:37.480 line:0%
So,

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:39.280 line:0%
let's chat again next time.

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:40.330 line:0%
Where's my gift?

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:43.450 line:0%
You didn't forget to prepare one, did you?

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:46.870 line:0%
Well, I did prepare something,

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:48.250 line:0%
but...

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:50.310 line:0%
It's not really suitable for you.

00:13:50.310 --> 00:13:51.480 line:0%
You definitely won't like it.

00:13:51.480 --> 00:13:52.080 line:0%
Next time,

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:53.000 line:0%
I'll buy you something

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:53.800 line:0%
newer.

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:55.350 line:0%
You haven't even shown it to me.

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:57.480 line:0%
How do you know whether I like it or not?

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:04.660 line:0%
You insisted on seeing it yourself.

00:14:17.360 --> 00:14:18.160 line:0%
Alright.

00:14:18.280 --> 00:14:19.240 line:0%
You've seen it.

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:20.520 line:0%
Are you convinced now?

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:24.640 line:0%
How can there be a reason

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:26.080 line:0%
to take back a gift given to someone?

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:26.880 line:0%
Besides,

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:27.920 line:0%
I really like it.

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:29.460 line:0%
I happen to be missing

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:30.770 line:0%
a hairpin.

00:14:33.240 --> 00:14:34.040 line:0%
So,

00:14:38.570 --> 00:14:40.700 line:0%
why don't you put it on for me yourself?

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:55.720 line:0%
How is it?

00:14:57.270 --> 00:14:58.070 line:0%
Is it good?

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.010 line:0%
Why did the candle suddenly go out?

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:06.740 line:0%
Could it be...

00:15:08.110 --> 00:15:09.570 line:0%
It's good, quite good.

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:10.480 line:0%
It's getting late.

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:11.780 line:0%
I really should go.

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:15.360 line:0%
See you.

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:51.250 line:0%
It's so late.

00:15:51.440 --> 00:15:53.500 line:0%
Are you planning to keep vigil for me?

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:07.200 line:0%
Why are you still staying there?

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:08.320 line:0%
Come and rest.

00:16:15.970 --> 00:16:16.880 line:0%
Forget it.

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:18.000 line:0%
It's not like

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:19.860 line:0%
we haven't slept in the same bed before.

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:21.040 line:0%
if I catch a cold,

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:22.960 line:0%
that would be asking for trouble.

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:33.630 line:0%
That Pan Chi,

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:36.260 line:0%
is he really that much to your liking?

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:38.150 line:0%
What do you mean by "to my liking"?

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:42.210 line:0%
Oh, you mean the investigation?

00:16:42.260 --> 00:16:44.170 line:0%
We do work well together.

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:44.820 line:0%
You...

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:49.620 line:0%
What are you doing?

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:50.620 line:0%
if you keep this up,

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:51.800 line:0%
I won't be so polite anymore.

00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:52.930 line:0%
You won't be polite?

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:55.780 line:0%
I'd like to see

00:16:55.810 --> 00:16:57.800 line:0%
how impolite you can be.

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:12.240 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:15.879 line:0%
why aren't you sleeping in the middle of the night?

00:17:15.879 --> 00:17:17.200 line:0%
Have you gone mad?

00:17:31.010 --> 00:17:33.810 line:0%
Someone is beating the drum to appeal for justice.

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:37.240 line:0%
Who is beating the drum below?

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:38.750 line:0%
What grievance do you have?

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:40.120 line:0%
My Lord,

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:42.570 line:0%
this humble citizen is named Du Fusheng.

00:17:42.570 --> 00:17:44.430 line:0%
I am an herbal medicine merchant.

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:45.320 line:0%
Today

00:17:45.320 --> 00:17:47.680 line:0%
is the wedding day of my youngest daughter, Du Xiaowan,

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:49.560 line:0%
to Li Zimou,

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:50.720 line:0%
son of Li Hongfa.

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:53.760 line:0%
But something strange and unexpected happened.

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:54.480 line:0%
My daughter

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:56.320 line:0%
was still present during the welcoming ceremony,

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:57.280 line:0%
but after the wedding banquet ended

00:17:57.280 --> 00:17:59.920 line:0%
and it was time for the newlyweds to enter their chamber,

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:01.920 line:0%
we discovered that she had disappeared.

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:03.320 line:0%
It happened so suddenly,

00:18:03.320 --> 00:18:04.880 line:0%
and we searched everywhere but couldn't find her.

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:08.010 line:0%
That's why we've come to report this to the authorities.

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:10.480 line:0%
On such a joyous day with many guests,

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:11.500 line:0%
this won't be easy to investigate.

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:12.830 line:0%
Do you have a guest list?

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:14.280 line:0%
Yes, yes,

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:15.600 line:0%
it's right here.

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:17.690 line:0%
Bring it to me.

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:24.400 line:0%
Was this marriage between your two families

00:18:24.400 --> 00:18:25.530 line:0%
a mutual agreement?

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:26.990 line:0%
Of course it was.

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:29.920 line:0%
Xiaowan and I are well-matched in social status.

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:31.120 line:0%
We admire each other.

00:18:31.800 --> 00:18:34.330 line:0%
Who could have known something like this would happen?

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:35.710 line:0%
I beg you, Governor Mo,

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:37.300 line:0%
please find Xiaowan.

00:18:40.880 --> 00:18:41.680 line:0%
Guards!

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:43.320 line:0%
Take some men to investigate both households.

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:44.520 line:0%
Pay special attention to the Li family's house.

00:18:44.520 --> 00:18:45.820 line:0%
Examine it carefully

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:46.760 line:0%
to see if there are any

00:18:46.760 --> 00:18:47.890 line:0%
traces left behind.

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:49.240 line:0%
Focus particularly

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:50.720 line:0%
on the entrances and exits of all areas.

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:51.520 line:0%
Yes, sir.

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:58.080 line:0%
Governor Mo,

00:18:57.580 --> 00:19:00.260 line:0%
[Wedding]

00:18:58.200 --> 00:18:59.840 line:0%
we've checked the guest list.

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:01.040 line:0%
Most of the guests are still here,

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:02.300 line:0%
only a few are missing.

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:03.720 line:0%
Find them.

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:05.880 line:0%
Bring them all back once you've found them.

00:19:05.880 --> 00:19:06.680 line:0%
Yes, sir.

00:19:09.360 --> 00:19:10.320 line:0%
What's the matter?

00:19:10.320 --> 00:19:11.120 line:0%
My Lord,

00:19:11.240 --> 00:19:12.720 line:0%
if we all go out to search for people,

00:19:12.720 --> 00:19:14.040 line:0%
I'm afraid there won't be enough manpower

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:14.960 line:0%
to investigate the scene.

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:17.290 line:0%
[Wedding]

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:17.720 line:0%
Governor Mo,

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:19.680 line:0%
if there's not enough manpower,

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:21.280 line:0%
my Imperial Guards can help.

00:19:25.710 --> 00:19:28.240 line:0%
Then I'll trouble you, Grand Commander Shen.

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:37.160 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:39.120 line:0%
Yes.

00:19:41.920 --> 00:19:42.720 line:0%
Go ahead.

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:43.920 line:0%
Yes, sir.

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:46.160 line:0%
You all, come with me.

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:47.440 line:0%
You too, come with me.

00:20:24.480 --> 00:20:26.610 line:0%
Li Hongfa comes from a wealthy family.

00:20:26.810 --> 00:20:27.600 line:0%
The wedding chamber must have been

00:20:27.600 --> 00:20:29.080 line:0%
carefully decorated.

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:31.080 line:0%
There are no signs of

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:32.610 line:0%
a struggle inside the room.

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:38.970 line:0%
[Wedding]

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:41.090 line:0%
It seems something happened in the wedding chamber,

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:42.330 line:0%
and in a fit of anger,

00:20:42.350 --> 00:20:44.010 line:0%
someone damaged this place.

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:45.560 line:0%
[Wedding]

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:48.630 line:0%
It's supposed to be a joyous occasion,

00:20:48.630 --> 00:20:50.630 line:0%
yet everything here seems strange.

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:52.720 line:0%
Moreover,

00:20:52.880 --> 00:20:53.760 line:0%
this doorframe clearly

00:20:53.760 --> 00:20:54.890 line:0%
has been renovated,

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:57.180 line:0%
but there are signs of peeling paint.

00:20:57.670 --> 00:20:59.250 line:0%
There must be something wrong here.

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:00.620 line:0%
I think so too.

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:02.200 line:0%
By the way,

00:21:02.220 --> 00:21:03.730 line:0%
did you find anything on your end?

00:21:03.730 --> 00:21:05.440 line:0%
I passed through the living room,

00:21:05.440 --> 00:21:06.920 line:0%
the corner pavilion,

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:08.250 line:0%
and the rockery.

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:09.680 line:0%
But along the way,

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:12.080 line:0%
I didn't find anything suspicious.

00:21:12.740 --> 00:21:14.070 line:0%
That's right.

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:19.200 line:0%
The bride didn't leave voluntarily.

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:20.760 line:0%
She was abducted by someone she knew

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:22.690 line:0%
and taken through the back window.

00:21:33.720 --> 00:21:35.520 line:0%
With such an urgent case at hand,

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:37.400 line:0%
you two still have the mood

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:38.400 line:0%
to chat idly here?

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:45.980 line:0%
Secretary Yan and I are analyzing the case.

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:47.280 line:0%
How is this idle chat?

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:48.620 line:0%
Besides,

00:21:49.340 --> 00:21:51.400 line:0%
we've already reached a conclusion.

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:52.800 line:0%
The bride

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:56.280 line:0%
was indeed abducted through this back window.

00:21:56.280 --> 00:21:57.080 line:0%
Alright,

00:21:57.290 --> 00:21:59.440 line:0%
now it's time for certain people to get busy.

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:01.970 line:0%
Quickly give orders to search for the person.

00:22:07.640 --> 00:22:08.440 line:0%
Alright.

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:10.800 line:0%
Please lead the way, Mr. Pan.

00:22:11.140 --> 00:22:12.740 line:0%
Come with my Imperial Guards

00:22:12.740 --> 00:22:14.000 line:0%
to pursue the suspect.

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:22.320 line:0%
Why did you leave halfway through the banquet?

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:23.830 line:0%
A servant came to report

00:22:23.880 --> 00:22:25.140 line:0%
that my child was sick.

00:22:25.240 --> 00:22:26.320 line:0%
My spouse

00:22:26.400 --> 00:22:28.730 line:0%
doesn't know how to take care of the child.

00:22:29.800 --> 00:22:31.800 line:0%
It was already that late;

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:32.680 line:0%
surely we were not

00:22:32.680 --> 00:22:34.480 line:0%
going to keep that up until dawn?

00:22:34.650 --> 00:22:35.800 line:0%
Prefectural Governor,

00:22:35.800 --> 00:22:36.800 line:0%
about this matter,

00:22:36.800 --> 00:22:37.520 line:0%
please

00:22:37.520 --> 00:22:38.920 line:0%
don't tell my wife.

00:22:39.480 --> 00:22:40.360 line:0%
I just came

00:22:40.360 --> 00:22:41.800 line:0%
to check on my mistress.

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:44.350 line:0%
During the wedding,

00:22:44.560 --> 00:22:45.970 line:0%
did anything

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:47.360 line:0%
strange happen?

00:22:47.400 --> 00:22:48.470 line:0%
Not really,

00:22:49.840 --> 00:22:51.270 line:0%
except that

00:22:51.400 --> 00:22:54.120 line:0%
Xu Jize performed exceptionally well.

00:22:54.520 --> 00:22:55.680 line:0%
I didn't notice anything

00:22:55.680 --> 00:22:56.840 line:0%
else unusual.

00:22:58.240 --> 00:22:59.360 line:0%
This Xu Jize,

00:22:59.360 --> 00:23:00.880 line:0%
he really had it tough.

00:23:01.000 --> 00:23:02.240 line:0%
The job of a wedding host

00:23:02.240 --> 00:23:03.640 line:0%
is not easy to begin with.

00:23:03.640 --> 00:23:05.800 line:0%
It's rare for someone from Yingzhou to do this.

00:23:05.800 --> 00:23:07.100 line:0%
But I heard

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:09.800 line:0%
that he had no one to recommend him

00:23:09.800 --> 00:23:11.040 line:0%
and couldn't find a way to take the exams,

00:23:11.040 --> 00:23:13.170 line:0%
so he ended up becoming a wedding host.

00:23:16.940 --> 00:23:18.000 line:0%
Please, everyone.

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:21.180 line:0%
What about that Xu Jize?

00:23:21.180 --> 00:23:22.240 line:0%
Why isn't he here?

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:24.640 line:0%
My Lord,

00:23:24.680 --> 00:23:25.560 line:0%
we couldn't find him.

00:23:25.560 --> 00:23:26.620 line:0%
Couldn't find him?

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:29.230 line:0%
In that case,

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:30.040 line:0%
Xu Jize

00:23:30.040 --> 00:23:31.840 line:0%
is the only one who left early

00:23:32.270 --> 00:23:33.280 line:0%
and could have close

00:23:33.280 --> 00:23:34.610 line:0%
contact with the bride.

00:23:35.480 --> 00:23:36.340 line:0%
Secretary Yan,

00:23:36.690 --> 00:23:37.810 line:0%
do you think

00:23:38.080 --> 00:23:39.960 line:0%
the culprit might be Xu Jize?

00:23:40.240 --> 00:23:41.720 line:0%
At this point, I can't answer

00:23:41.720 --> 00:23:42.580 line:0%
your question.

00:23:43.400 --> 00:23:44.950 line:0%
Before the case is solved,

00:23:45.040 --> 00:23:46.480 line:0%
everyone present

00:23:46.520 --> 00:23:47.600 line:0%
is a suspect.

00:23:48.530 --> 00:23:50.310 line:0%
And his absence now

00:23:50.440 --> 00:23:51.480 line:0%
only means

00:23:51.520 --> 00:23:53.250 line:0%
his suspicion is even greater.

00:23:54.600 --> 00:23:55.280 line:0%
In the end,

00:23:55.280 --> 00:23:58.410 line:0%
we still need physical evidence and witness testimony.

00:24:02.050 --> 00:24:04.710 line:0%
As expected of the wife of Grand Commander Shen,

00:24:04.960 --> 00:24:06.090 line:0%
though young in age,

00:24:06.160 --> 00:24:08.080 line:0%
your words and actions are impeccable,

00:24:08.080 --> 00:24:10.080 line:0%
with a set of principles of your own.

00:24:10.560 --> 00:24:12.200 line:0%
From your words, Governor Mo,

00:24:12.200 --> 00:24:13.720 line:0%
it seems you are quite familiar

00:24:13.720 --> 00:24:14.650 line:0%
with my husband?

00:24:17.240 --> 00:24:19.320 line:0%
Take them all back to the Governor's Mansion.

00:24:19.320 --> 00:24:20.120 line:0%
Yes, sir.

00:24:20.960 --> 00:24:21.760 line:0%
Let's go.

00:24:34.410 --> 00:24:35.960 line:0%
[Xu Jize]

00:24:52.790 --> 00:24:54.350 line:0%
Please don't kill me.

00:24:54.670 --> 00:24:56.270 line:0%
Don't kill me, don't kill me.

00:24:56.480 --> 00:24:57.480 line:0%
Who are you?

00:24:57.630 --> 00:25:00.350 line:0%
Why are you fleeing in panic in the middle of the night?

00:25:00.350 --> 00:25:01.730 line:0%
My name is Xu Jize.

00:25:02.120 --> 00:25:04.270 line:0%
Don't kill me. D-Don't kill me.

00:25:04.440 --> 00:25:05.240 line:0%
Over there.

00:25:07.310 --> 00:25:09.860 line:0%
There are dead people over there, over there.

00:25:11.110 --> 00:25:12.540 line:0%
Xu Jize.

00:25:14.080 --> 00:25:15.540 line:0%
You're that wedding host?

00:25:17.460 --> 00:25:19.060 line:0%
Hand him over to Governor Mo.

00:25:24.450 --> 00:25:26.340 line:0%
Well, well, Shen Du.

00:25:26.560 --> 00:25:28.600 line:0%
Throwing an ordinary civilian out there as a roadblock.

00:25:28.600 --> 00:25:30.400 line:0%
Is this how the Imperial Security Bureau operates?

00:25:30.400 --> 00:25:32.520 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau's style?

00:25:32.520 --> 00:25:34.560 line:0%
Is it a machine that kills without hesitation,

00:25:34.560 --> 00:25:36.160 line:0%
or a bogeyman that stops children from crying

00:25:36.160 --> 00:25:36.960 line:0%
at night?

00:25:39.560 --> 00:25:41.080 line:0%
Which one

00:25:41.080 --> 00:25:42.160 line:0%
do you prefer?

00:25:49.320 --> 00:25:52.040 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen, I'm impressed by your self-awareness.

00:25:52.040 --> 00:25:53.200 line:0%
I admire you.

00:25:53.700 --> 00:25:54.700 line:0%
Truly admire you.

00:25:55.080 --> 00:25:56.740 line:0%
But since we've come this far,

00:25:57.360 --> 00:25:58.890 line:0%
why don't we speak frankly?

00:25:59.000 --> 00:26:00.500 line:0%
You're constantly targeting me,

00:26:00.500 --> 00:26:01.760 line:0%
finding fault with everything I do.

00:26:01.760 --> 00:26:02.820 line:0%
If that's the case,

00:26:02.840 --> 00:26:03.800 line:0%
why do you insist on dragging me along

00:26:03.800 --> 00:26:04.600 line:0%
to chase after the killer?

00:26:04.600 --> 00:26:06.800 line:0%
Mr. Pan, you also have self-awareness.

00:26:07.420 --> 00:26:09.280 line:0%
Knowing that you're an eyesore to me,

00:26:09.280 --> 00:26:10.800 line:0%
why do you keep showing up?

00:26:11.540 --> 00:26:13.520 line:0%
That's for the needs of solving the case.

00:26:13.520 --> 00:26:14.450 line:0%
I have no choice.

00:26:15.160 --> 00:26:16.820 line:0%
The needs of solving the case?

00:26:17.500 --> 00:26:20.470 line:0%
Seeing me arrive, you escalated your actions.

00:26:21.150 --> 00:26:22.810 line:0%
Is that also out of necessity?

00:26:35.960 --> 00:26:37.550 line:0%
Help!

00:26:40.200 --> 00:26:41.360 line:0%
Why did it go quiet?

00:27:14.260 --> 00:27:15.060 line:0%
You,

00:27:16.440 --> 00:27:17.440 line:0%
go down and check.

00:27:18.490 --> 00:27:20.290 line:0%
Why should I be the one to go down?

00:27:20.600 --> 00:27:21.680 line:0%
You are

00:27:21.680 --> 00:27:22.480 line:0%
the Grand Commander.

00:27:22.480 --> 00:27:23.960 line:0%
Who knows what's happening down there?

00:27:23.960 --> 00:27:24.600 line:0%
Besides,

00:27:24.600 --> 00:27:25.080 line:0%
if I go down

00:27:25.080 --> 00:27:26.540 line:0%
and get killed, what then?

00:27:27.770 --> 00:27:29.090 line:0%
If you die,

00:27:29.920 --> 00:27:31.280 line:0%
I'll collect your body,

00:27:31.640 --> 00:27:33.040 line:0%
build you a tomb,

00:27:33.040 --> 00:27:34.080 line:0%
and make sure your soul

00:27:34.080 --> 00:27:35.120 line:0%
doesn't wander around

00:27:35.120 --> 00:27:36.160 line:0%
scaring people.

00:27:36.160 --> 00:27:38.760 line:0%
-Why are you so mean?
-You canâ€™t beat me, right?

00:27:39.140 --> 00:27:40.200 line:0%
Go down.

00:27:42.740 --> 00:27:45.570 line:0%
I'll go check out the situation first.

00:27:57.360 --> 00:27:58.250 line:0%
You are...

00:27:59.290 --> 00:28:01.490 line:0%
Don't be afraid. I'm here to rescue you.

00:28:09.160 --> 00:28:10.160 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:28:31.800 --> 00:28:33.450 line:0%
You're the bride from today, aren't you?

00:28:33.450 --> 00:28:35.430 line:0%
[Du Xiaowan]

00:28:36.760 --> 00:28:37.560 line:0%
Yes.

00:28:38.150 --> 00:28:39.670 line:0%
I am Du Xiaowan.

00:28:39.740 --> 00:28:41.540 line:0%
Please save me, My Lord! Please!

00:28:44.160 --> 00:28:45.670 line:0%
There's another person down there.

00:28:45.670 --> 00:28:46.790 line:0%
Another one.

00:28:53.320 --> 00:28:55.050 line:0%
At least you have a conscience.

00:28:55.240 --> 00:28:56.710 line:0%
I climbed up by myself.

00:28:57.840 --> 00:28:58.810 line:0%
My back!

00:29:01.960 --> 00:29:03.400 line:0%
And you call yourself a Grand Commander.

00:29:03.400 --> 00:29:05.080 line:0%
Do you even understand the code of honor?

00:29:05.080 --> 00:29:07.040 line:0%
You've framed me time and time again.

00:29:07.040 --> 00:29:08.250 line:0%
It's not you.

00:29:09.850 --> 00:29:11.100 line:0%
There's another one.

00:29:11.810 --> 00:29:13.620 line:0%
A dead person.

00:29:33.600 --> 00:29:34.440 line:0%
You guys,

00:29:35.400 --> 00:29:36.600 line:0%
go check the surroundings.

00:29:36.600 --> 00:29:37.520 line:0%
Jing Lin,

00:29:37.840 --> 00:29:38.600 line:0%
go see if there's

00:29:38.600 --> 00:29:39.610 line:0%
anything unusual down below.

00:29:39.610 --> 00:29:40.170 line:0%
Yes.

00:30:14.450 --> 00:30:15.530 line:0%
Reporting, Grand Commander.

00:30:15.530 --> 00:30:16.810 line:0%
There are no abnormalities down below.

00:30:16.810 --> 00:30:17.590 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:30:17.590 --> 00:30:18.660 line:0%
the surroundings have all been checked.

00:30:18.660 --> 00:30:19.990 line:0%
There are no anomalies.

00:30:20.080 --> 00:30:21.060 line:0%
All along the way,

00:30:21.060 --> 00:30:22.060 line:0%
we all saw

00:30:22.090 --> 00:30:23.270 line:0%
that nervous-looking

00:30:23.270 --> 00:30:24.290 line:0%
wedding host suspect.

00:30:24.290 --> 00:30:26.040 line:0%
Why do you still need to investigate repeatedly?

00:30:26.040 --> 00:30:27.200 line:0%
Are you so certain

00:30:27.240 --> 00:30:29.170 line:0%
that this person is not the killer?

00:30:29.440 --> 00:30:30.280 line:0%
I can't be certain

00:30:30.280 --> 00:30:31.700 line:0%
whether that person is the killer or not,

00:30:31.700 --> 00:30:33.350 line:0%
but my intuition tells me

00:30:33.980 --> 00:30:34.980 line:0%
that this matter

00:30:36.280 --> 00:30:37.200 line:0%
is not as simple

00:30:37.200 --> 00:30:38.260 line:0%
as what we've seen.

00:30:40.020 --> 00:30:42.140 line:0%
I must say, I'm truly impressed.

00:30:42.400 --> 00:30:44.490 line:0%
So the esteemed Grand Commander solves cases

00:30:44.490 --> 00:30:45.360 line:0%
based on nothing but

00:30:45.360 --> 00:30:47.020 line:0%
an innate, gifted intuition.

00:30:49.000 --> 00:30:49.880 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:30:49.880 --> 00:30:52.010 line:0%
shall we continue the investigation?

00:30:53.920 --> 00:30:54.850 line:0%
Let's withdraw.

00:31:07.060 --> 00:31:08.840 line:0%
-Where is she?
-You bastard!

00:31:08.840 --> 00:31:10.360 line:0%
Give me back my daughter!

00:31:10.360 --> 00:31:11.640 line:0%
Where have you hidden her?

00:31:11.640 --> 00:31:12.520 line:0%
Where's Xiaowan?

00:31:12.520 --> 00:31:13.790 line:0%
Answer me!

00:31:14.760 --> 00:31:15.520 line:0%
You beast!

00:31:15.520 --> 00:31:16.240 line:0%
In this court,

00:31:16.240 --> 00:31:17.700 line:0%
you must behave yourself.

00:31:18.440 --> 00:31:19.240 line:0%
Xu Jize,

00:31:19.560 --> 00:31:20.800 line:0%
I ask you,

00:31:21.200 --> 00:31:22.880 line:0%
is the case of Lady Du's disappearance

00:31:22.880 --> 00:31:24.230 line:0%
related to you in any way?

00:31:24.230 --> 00:31:25.800 line:0%
I've been wronged, My Lord!

00:31:25.920 --> 00:31:27.240 line:0%
The abduction of Lady Du

00:31:27.240 --> 00:31:28.640 line:0%
has nothing to do with me.

00:31:28.640 --> 00:31:30.170 line:0%
I only wanted to rescue her.

00:31:30.200 --> 00:31:31.560 line:0%
Do you have any witnesses or evidence

00:31:31.560 --> 00:31:32.640 line:0%
to prove this?

00:31:33.000 --> 00:31:33.800 line:0%
My Lord,

00:31:34.080 --> 00:31:35.480 line:0%
it happened so suddenly.

00:31:35.720 --> 00:31:37.240 line:0%
I was in a hurry to save her.

00:31:37.360 --> 00:31:38.920 line:0%
No one saw what happened.

00:31:39.120 --> 00:31:40.640 line:0%
But every word I say is true.

00:31:40.640 --> 00:31:42.400 line:0%
I beg you to see the truth, My Lord.

00:31:42.400 --> 00:31:44.730 line:0%
So you have no witnesses or evidence then.

00:31:48.240 --> 00:31:49.040 line:0%
Madam,

00:31:49.080 --> 00:31:50.810 line:0%
Grand Commander has returned.

00:32:04.730 --> 00:32:06.280 line:0%
You're finally back.

00:32:06.320 --> 00:32:07.840 line:0%
Did you find anything?

00:32:09.250 --> 00:32:10.630 line:0%
We found the bride.

00:32:11.200 --> 00:32:12.680 line:0%
And we brought back a body.

00:32:15.170 --> 00:32:16.340 line:0%
Someone died?

00:32:17.700 --> 00:32:18.830 line:0%
How about you?

00:32:18.900 --> 00:32:19.980 line:0%
Are you hurt?

00:32:21.150 --> 00:32:22.580 line:0%
I'm not someone who

00:32:23.200 --> 00:32:25.480 line:0%
can be easily injured.

00:32:26.200 --> 00:32:27.660 line:0%
You needn't worry, Honey.

00:32:28.210 --> 00:32:29.670 line:0%
What's wrong with you now?

00:32:29.760 --> 00:32:31.200 line:0%
Why are your hands all wounded?

00:32:31.200 --> 00:32:32.800 line:0%
And there's mud all over you.

00:32:35.720 --> 00:32:36.760 line:0%
You should ask that

00:32:36.760 --> 00:32:38.160 line:0%
clever husband of yours.

00:32:38.790 --> 00:32:39.680 line:0%
All the way here,

00:32:39.680 --> 00:32:41.400 line:0%
I did all the dirty work alone,

00:32:41.990 --> 00:32:44.650 line:0%
and in the end, someone else took all the credit.

00:32:46.690 --> 00:32:47.920 line:0%
Anyway,

00:32:48.040 --> 00:32:49.360 line:0%
it's good that you both

00:32:49.360 --> 00:32:50.360 line:0%
returned safely.

00:32:50.720 --> 00:32:51.480 line:0%
Oh, right,

00:32:51.480 --> 00:32:52.320 line:0%
about the bride,

00:32:52.320 --> 00:32:53.640 line:0%
how did you bring her back?

00:32:53.640 --> 00:32:55.040 line:0%
Tell me the details.

00:32:55.800 --> 00:32:57.000 line:0%
First, on the way,

00:32:57.080 --> 00:32:57.400 line:0%
we encountered

00:32:57.400 --> 00:32:59.130 line:0%
the panicked suspect fleeing.

00:32:59.240 --> 00:32:59.960 line:0%
Then we found

00:32:59.960 --> 00:33:01.890 line:0%
the bride trapped in a cellar well.

00:33:02.080 --> 00:33:03.040 line:0%
In that cellar well,

00:33:03.040 --> 00:33:04.200 line:0%
besides the bride,

00:33:04.680 --> 00:33:06.010 line:0%
there was also a corpse.

00:33:06.160 --> 00:33:07.690 line:0%
So we brought them all back.

00:33:07.840 --> 00:33:09.920 line:0%
The suspect you mentioned,

00:33:10.480 --> 00:33:12.000 line:0%
is he the one the Imperial Guards brought back earlier,

00:33:12.000 --> 00:33:13.200 line:0%
that Xu Jize?

00:33:14.160 --> 00:33:15.690 line:0%
Yes, he's the wedding host.

00:33:17.040 --> 00:33:18.320 line:0%
After you left,

00:33:18.600 --> 00:33:19.840 line:0%
I also investigated

00:33:19.840 --> 00:33:21.000 line:0%
the wedding guests.

00:33:21.400 --> 00:33:22.960 line:0%
According to them, Xu Jize

00:33:22.960 --> 00:33:24.440 line:0%
is a really good person.

00:33:24.760 --> 00:33:25.720 line:0%
On the surface,

00:33:26.000 --> 00:33:28.530 line:0%
he doesn't seem to have a motive for the crime.

00:33:28.920 --> 00:33:30.200 line:0%
Whether he's the culprit or not

00:33:30.200 --> 00:33:31.520 line:0%
still needs to be determined.

00:33:31.520 --> 00:33:32.320 line:0%
Oh, right,

00:33:33.080 --> 00:33:34.920 line:0%
when we were at the bottom of the well,

00:33:34.920 --> 00:33:36.450 line:0%
I remember there was a sack.

00:33:36.600 --> 00:33:37.560 line:0%
That sack

00:33:37.880 --> 00:33:38.680 line:0%
was probably used

00:33:38.680 --> 00:33:40.210 line:0%
to kidnap the bride, right?

00:33:40.290 --> 00:33:41.750 line:0%
Such important evidence,

00:33:42.270 --> 00:33:44.160 line:0%
why didn't you mention it earlier?

00:33:44.160 --> 00:33:45.800 line:0%
I'm not your subordinate.

00:33:46.280 --> 00:33:47.040 line:0%
Why should I

00:33:47.040 --> 00:33:48.500 line:0%
report everything to you?

00:33:51.660 --> 00:33:52.570 line:0%
Alright.

00:33:52.960 --> 00:33:54.760 line:0%
Go change your clothes quickly.

00:33:54.840 --> 00:33:56.320 line:0%
I'll wait for you in the lobby.

00:33:56.320 --> 00:33:58.520 line:0%
This is a matter for the Yingzhou government office.

00:33:58.520 --> 00:34:00.980 line:0%
It should be decided by Governor Mo himself.

00:34:01.440 --> 00:34:02.900 line:0%
I won't go to the hall then.

00:34:25.030 --> 00:34:25.990 line:0%
Sir, you have no evidence.

00:34:25.990 --> 00:34:27.320 line:0%
Yet you've arrested me.

00:34:27.360 --> 00:34:28.890 line:0%
I'm innocent, I tell you!

00:34:29.360 --> 00:34:30.920 line:0%
-I risked my life...
-Where is the trial?

00:34:30.920 --> 00:34:31.760 line:0%
To save Lady Du.

00:34:31.760 --> 00:34:33.300 line:0%
I missed some of it earlier.

00:34:33.600 --> 00:34:35.680 line:0%
-I have no idea.
-And she wasn't hurt.

00:34:35.680 --> 00:34:37.030 line:0%
She just sprained her ankle.

00:34:37.030 --> 00:34:37.990 line:0%
My Lord,

00:34:38.140 --> 00:34:39.630 line:0%
shouldn't you treat me

00:34:40.050 --> 00:34:41.510 line:0%
with a different attitude?

00:34:41.510 --> 00:34:42.280 line:0%
This person really is

00:34:42.280 --> 00:34:43.880 line:0%
good at flattering himself.

00:34:44.160 --> 00:34:45.600 line:0%
Before the evidence is presented,

00:34:45.600 --> 00:34:47.600 line:0%
he completely absolves himself of any wrongdoing.

00:34:47.600 --> 00:34:49.530 line:0%
He even demands respect in court.

00:34:49.800 --> 00:34:51.160 line:0%
It's the first time I've seen

00:34:51.160 --> 00:34:52.510 line:0%
someone so arrogant.

00:34:53.140 --> 00:34:54.530 line:0%
A tree without bark

00:34:54.650 --> 00:34:55.999 line:0%
will surely die.

00:34:56.240 --> 00:34:57.460 line:0%
A shameless person

00:34:57.680 --> 00:34:59.280 line:0%
is unbeatable under heaven.

00:34:59.400 --> 00:34:59.760 line:0%
You're

00:34:59.760 --> 00:35:02.040 line:0%
refusing to believe until you see the coffin, aren't you?

00:35:02.040 --> 00:35:02.840 line:0%
Governor Mo,

00:35:03.120 --> 00:35:04.850 line:0%
I have new evidence to present.

00:35:06.640 --> 00:35:07.440 line:0%
Xu Jize,

00:35:07.850 --> 00:35:08.950 line:0%
does this item

00:35:09.680 --> 00:35:12.050 line:0%
look familiar to you?

00:35:12.470 --> 00:35:14.080 line:0%
This has nothing to do with me.

00:35:14.080 --> 00:35:15.560 line:0%
It must belong to the real culprit.

00:35:15.560 --> 00:35:16.440 line:0%
It was all that dead person

00:35:16.440 --> 00:35:17.500 line:0%
who harmed Lady Du.

00:35:17.800 --> 00:35:18.880 line:0%
I was just there to save her.

00:35:18.880 --> 00:35:20.480 line:0%
Don't wrongly accuse an innocent person!

00:35:20.480 --> 00:35:21.920 line:0%
Then tell us in detail

00:35:22.020 --> 00:35:22.980 line:0%
what you saw.

00:35:24.480 --> 00:35:25.280 line:0%
I...

00:35:26.080 --> 00:35:28.250 line:0%
I just went to the outhouse.

00:35:28.760 --> 00:35:29.800 line:0%
When I came out,

00:35:29.800 --> 00:35:30.840 line:0%
I saw the criminal

00:35:30.840 --> 00:35:32.490 line:0%
kidnapping Lady Du.

00:35:32.800 --> 00:35:34.200 line:0%
It happened so suddenly.

00:35:34.320 --> 00:35:35.080 line:0%
I didn't have time

00:35:35.080 --> 00:35:36.200 line:0%
to notify others.

00:35:36.320 --> 00:35:38.120 line:0%
Worried about Lady Du's safety,

00:35:38.560 --> 00:35:40.240 line:0%
I went to rescue her alone.

00:35:40.440 --> 00:35:41.880 line:0%
You have no proof.

00:35:42.560 --> 00:35:43.930 line:0%
How can anyone believe you?

00:35:43.930 --> 00:35:45.080 line:0%
Heaven and Earth know

00:35:45.080 --> 00:35:46.680 line:0%
that every word I say is true.

00:35:46.700 --> 00:35:48.650 line:0%
I beg you all to see clearly.

00:35:49.240 --> 00:35:50.900 line:0%
Let me help you tell the story.

00:35:51.370 --> 00:35:53.570 line:0%
You and the deceased were accomplices.

00:35:53.800 --> 00:35:55.640 line:0%
You kidnapped Lady Du together.

00:35:55.760 --> 00:35:57.360 line:0%
Then, due to a disagreement,

00:35:57.440 --> 00:35:59.170 line:0%
you killed your accomplice.

00:35:59.440 --> 00:36:00.850 line:0%
To cover up the truth,

00:36:00.970 --> 00:36:02.990 line:0%
you pretended to be a good person.

00:36:03.110 --> 00:36:04.240 line:0%
You shifted all the blame

00:36:04.240 --> 00:36:06.040 line:0%
away from yourself completely.

00:36:06.130 --> 00:36:07.040 line:0%
My Lord.

00:36:07.040 --> 00:36:07.920 line:0%
It's unjust!

00:36:07.920 --> 00:36:09.350 line:0%
I really didn't kill anyone.

00:36:09.350 --> 00:36:11.360 line:0%
I don't even know the deceased.

00:36:11.360 --> 00:36:12.920 line:0%
Why would I have killed him?

00:36:17.200 --> 00:36:18.600 line:0%
When people lie,

00:36:18.840 --> 00:36:20.100 line:0%
they blink constantly

00:36:20.480 --> 00:36:22.210 line:0%
and tend to wrinkle their nose.

00:36:22.880 --> 00:36:23.640 line:0%
But just now when he said

00:36:23.640 --> 00:36:24.960 line:0%
he didn't kill anyone,

00:36:25.360 --> 00:36:27.360 line:0%
his expression was unusually firm.

00:36:27.680 --> 00:36:29.340 line:0%
This suggests he's not lying.

00:36:29.680 --> 00:36:31.680 line:0%
Since you didn't know the deceased,

00:36:31.760 --> 00:36:33.820 line:0%
how did you witness him being killed?

00:36:34.180 --> 00:36:35.480 line:0%
I didn't actually see it

00:36:35.480 --> 00:36:36.520 line:0%
with my own eyes.

00:36:36.800 --> 00:36:38.000 line:0%
When I got there,

00:36:38.080 --> 00:36:39.160 line:0%
the person was already dead.

00:36:39.160 --> 00:36:40.160 line:0%
According to what you're saying,

00:36:40.160 --> 00:36:40.840 line:0%
you saw someone

00:36:40.840 --> 00:36:42.200 line:0%
abduct Lady Du.

00:36:42.220 --> 00:36:45.080 line:0%
Did this person have any distinguishing features?

00:36:46.760 --> 00:36:47.960 line:0%
At that time,

00:36:48.130 --> 00:36:49.860 line:0%
the lighting wasn't very good.

00:36:50.170 --> 00:36:51.900 line:0%
I couldn't see clearly either.

00:36:51.960 --> 00:36:52.760 line:0%
However,

00:36:53.090 --> 00:36:54.280 line:0%
judging from the deceased's height

00:36:54.280 --> 00:36:55.520 line:0%
and demeanor,

00:36:55.520 --> 00:36:56.160 line:0%
it should be

00:36:56.160 --> 00:36:57.720 line:0%
the person who abducted Lady Du.

00:36:57.720 --> 00:36:58.520 line:0%
Just from the height

00:36:58.520 --> 00:36:59.960 line:0%
and demeanor,

00:37:00.890 --> 00:37:02.000 line:0%
didn't you notice

00:37:02.000 --> 00:37:03.400 line:0%
any other characteristics?

00:37:03.400 --> 00:37:04.800 line:0%
It happened so suddenly,

00:37:05.360 --> 00:37:07.890 line:0%
I didn't pay much attention to anything else.

00:37:08.440 --> 00:37:10.220 line:0%
My Lord, Du Xiaowan has arrived.

00:37:10.220 --> 00:37:13.090 line:0%
Wan'er, my Wan'er.

00:37:13.400 --> 00:37:15.240 line:0%
-It's okay.
-Child.

00:37:15.460 --> 00:37:16.320 line:0%
That's enough.

00:37:17.170 --> 00:37:18.140 line:0%
Du Xiaowan,

00:37:18.770 --> 00:37:20.320 line:0%
you are the person involved.

00:37:20.320 --> 00:37:22.040 line:0%
recount everything that happened today,

00:37:22.040 --> 00:37:23.080 line:0%
one by one.

00:37:23.680 --> 00:37:24.480 line:0%
Xiaowan,

00:37:25.280 --> 00:37:27.320 line:0%
we have already performed the wedding ceremony.

00:37:27.320 --> 00:37:29.160 line:0%
You are my wife.

00:37:32.160 --> 00:37:34.350 line:0%
I, Li Zimo, hereby swear to heaven

00:37:34.880 --> 00:37:36.400 line:0%
that I will absolutely not

00:37:36.400 --> 00:37:39.200 line:0%
harbor any resentment because of today's events.

00:37:50.520 --> 00:37:51.400 line:0%
Lady Du,

00:37:51.960 --> 00:37:54.440 line:0%
I know women value their reputation

00:37:54.460 --> 00:37:56.330 line:0%
and it makes it difficult for you to speak up.

00:37:56.330 --> 00:37:57.860 line:0%
But have you considered

00:37:58.440 --> 00:38:00.730 line:0%
if the culprit is not brought to justice,

00:38:00.750 --> 00:38:02.560 line:0%
more young women will

00:38:02.560 --> 00:38:04.170 line:0%
fall victim to this evil in the future?

00:38:04.170 --> 00:38:06.200 line:0%
They might not all be as fortunate as you

00:38:06.200 --> 00:38:07.660 line:0%
to have a chance of rescue.

00:38:07.680 --> 00:38:08.480 line:0%
Honey,

00:38:08.840 --> 00:38:10.440 line:0%
shall we work together to help the Governor Mo

00:38:10.440 --> 00:38:11.500 line:0%
catch the culprit?

00:38:11.560 --> 00:38:12.420 line:0%
What do you say?

00:38:20.230 --> 00:38:22.830 line:0%
After performing the ceremony to heaven and earth,

00:38:22.830 --> 00:38:25.280 line:0%
I met the wedding host in the bridal chamber.

00:38:25.280 --> 00:38:26.420 line:0%
But then,

00:38:26.450 --> 00:38:27.360 line:0%
somehow,

00:38:27.360 --> 00:38:28.680 line:0%
I suddenly fainted.

00:38:28.960 --> 00:38:30.170 line:0%
When I woke up,

00:38:30.200 --> 00:38:32.080 line:0%
I was already inside a sack.

00:38:32.110 --> 00:38:34.410 line:0%
I didn't see who kidnapped me.

00:38:34.680 --> 00:38:36.240 line:0%
I was terrified at that time.

00:38:36.240 --> 00:38:37.800 line:0%
I couldn't even scream.

00:38:38.360 --> 00:38:39.320 line:0%
I only knew that

00:38:39.320 --> 00:38:40.760 line:0%
I was wrapped in a sack,

00:38:40.840 --> 00:38:42.840 line:0%
carried on someone's shoulder as they ran.

00:38:42.840 --> 00:38:44.200 line:0%
After a very long time,

00:38:44.240 --> 00:38:45.950 line:0%
I was finally put down.

00:38:46.430 --> 00:38:47.800 line:0%
Then another person came.

00:38:47.800 --> 00:38:48.680 line:0%
Did you hear

00:38:48.680 --> 00:38:50.000 line:0%
what they were saying?

00:38:51.800 --> 00:38:52.800 line:0%
I thought that person

00:38:52.800 --> 00:38:54.130 line:0%
was coming to rescue me,

00:38:54.960 --> 00:38:56.170 line:0%
but I never expected

00:38:56.360 --> 00:38:58.400 line:0%
that the two of them were actually accomplices.

00:38:58.400 --> 00:39:00.240 line:0%
They were discussing together

00:39:00.360 --> 00:39:01.800 line:0%
how to share me.

00:39:01.800 --> 00:39:03.680 line:0%
The words were truly unbearable to hear.

00:39:03.680 --> 00:39:06.160 line:0%
I really can't bring myself to repeat them.

00:39:06.890 --> 00:39:07.810 line:0%
My Lords,

00:39:08.480 --> 00:39:10.480 line:0%
my wife has suffered such an insult.

00:39:10.560 --> 00:39:11.760 line:0%
I implore you,

00:39:11.760 --> 00:39:13.240 line:0%
to severely punish the culprits.

00:39:13.240 --> 00:39:14.440 line:0%
Rest assured, Mr. Li,

00:39:14.600 --> 00:39:15.840 line:0%
we will not let the perpetrators

00:39:15.840 --> 00:39:16.880 line:0%
escape justice.

00:39:18.310 --> 00:39:20.240 line:0%
Later, I don't know what happened,

00:39:20.310 --> 00:39:22.310 line:0%
but the two of them started arguing.

00:39:23.120 --> 00:39:24.050 line:0%
I made a mistake.

00:39:24.060 --> 00:39:25.120 line:0%
Let's release her.

00:39:25.160 --> 00:39:26.320 line:0%
Are you kidding?

00:39:26.320 --> 00:39:27.080 line:0%
What's done is done.

00:39:27.080 --> 00:39:28.410 line:0%
You have to go through with it whether you like it or not.

00:39:28.410 --> 00:39:29.810 line:0%
I'll go check over there.

00:39:29.880 --> 00:39:31.050 line:0%
After a while,

00:39:31.080 --> 00:39:33.360 line:0%
it seemed like they heard someone chasing from behind.

00:39:33.360 --> 00:39:34.640 line:0%
They then abandoned me in

00:39:34.640 --> 00:39:36.100 line:0%
a cellar well in the ruins.

00:39:36.120 --> 00:39:38.320 line:0%
Before they could even close the cellar cover,

00:39:38.320 --> 00:39:39.960 line:0%
I heard a scream,

00:39:40.080 --> 00:39:41.770 line:0%
followed by a thud.

00:39:42.160 --> 00:39:42.960 line:0%
It seemed like someone

00:39:42.960 --> 00:39:44.510 line:0%
had fallen beside me.

00:39:44.760 --> 00:39:45.880 line:0%
The sack loosened,

00:39:45.920 --> 00:39:47.240 line:0%
and I crawled out.

00:39:50.680 --> 00:39:51.940 line:0%
Help!

00:39:52.400 --> 00:39:54.050 line:0%
I heard someone coming,

00:39:54.320 --> 00:39:55.120 line:0%
but I was afraid it was

00:39:55.120 --> 00:39:57.380 line:0%
the accomplice who had run away earlier.

00:39:57.400 --> 00:39:59.010 line:0%
So I stopped calling for help

00:39:59.560 --> 00:40:00.320 line:0%
until someone

00:40:00.320 --> 00:40:01.400 line:0%
jumped down from the well opening

00:40:01.400 --> 00:40:02.440 line:0%
and rescued me.

00:40:05.250 --> 00:40:07.110 line:0%
Since you've heard them talking,

00:40:07.320 --> 00:40:08.880 line:0%
can you identify by voice

00:40:08.920 --> 00:40:09.840 line:0%
if that person

00:40:09.970 --> 00:40:11.170 line:0%
was Xu Jize?

00:40:14.790 --> 00:40:15.680 line:0%
The situation was critical.

00:40:15.680 --> 00:40:17.160 line:0%
I was terrified.

00:40:17.400 --> 00:40:19.340 line:0%
I was so scared my head was buzzing.

00:40:19.550 --> 00:40:21.790 line:0%
I couldn't make out whose voice it was.

00:40:24.340 --> 00:40:25.400 line:0%
Lady Du has already

00:40:25.400 --> 00:40:26.460 line:0%
made it very clear.

00:40:26.480 --> 00:40:28.480 line:0%
In her last moment before fainting,

00:40:28.800 --> 00:40:30.400 line:0%
she saw Xu Jize.

00:40:30.720 --> 00:40:32.720 line:0%
Whether you're the murderer or not,

00:40:32.800 --> 00:40:33.720 line:0%
this case

00:40:33.720 --> 00:40:35.520 line:0%
is definitely connected to you.

00:40:35.520 --> 00:40:36.270 line:0%
I...

00:40:36.880 --> 00:40:38.840 line:0%
Xu Jize, you bastard!

00:40:39.040 --> 00:40:40.200 line:0%
Bastard!

00:40:40.360 --> 00:40:41.430 line:0%
Beast!

00:40:41.840 --> 00:40:42.640 line:0%
Order!

00:40:42.660 --> 00:40:43.620 line:0%
You beast!

00:40:43.650 --> 00:40:45.420 line:0%
No outbursts in the court!

00:40:47.600 --> 00:40:48.400 line:0%
Madam,

00:40:48.400 --> 00:40:49.560 line:0%
Grand Commander couldn't come in person,

00:40:49.560 --> 00:40:50.560 line:0%
so he sent me to present

00:40:50.560 --> 00:40:52.760 line:0%
the evidence for this case to the court.

00:40:54.040 --> 00:40:55.120 line:0%
There's evidence?

00:40:55.400 --> 00:40:56.530 line:0%
He has a backup plan?

00:40:56.920 --> 00:40:58.650 line:0%
Why wasn't I informed earlier?

00:40:59.000 --> 00:41:00.400 line:0%
I'm not your subordinate.

00:41:00.400 --> 00:41:02.530 line:0%
Why should I report everything to you?

00:41:03.920 --> 00:41:05.380 line:0%
Indeed, his subordinate.

00:41:05.680 --> 00:41:06.880 line:0%
So petty.

00:41:07.280 --> 00:41:08.080 line:0%
Xu Jize,

00:41:08.360 --> 00:41:09.440 line:0%
at this point,

00:41:09.440 --> 00:41:10.840 line:0%
what do you have to say for yourself?

00:41:10.840 --> 00:41:11.600 line:0%
My Lord,

00:41:11.600 --> 00:41:12.930 line:0%
I'm truly innocent.

00:41:13.120 --> 00:41:14.180 line:0%
On the wedding day,

00:41:14.200 --> 00:41:16.200 line:0%
brides often go without food all day

00:41:16.200 --> 00:41:16.960 line:0%
and faint from exhaustion.

00:41:16.960 --> 00:41:18.420 line:0%
It's a common occurrence.

00:41:18.640 --> 00:41:20.520 line:0%
As soon as I saw the bride was unwell,

00:41:20.520 --> 00:41:21.320 line:0%
to avoid suspicion,

00:41:21.320 --> 00:41:22.760 line:0%
I immediately left the room.

00:41:22.760 --> 00:41:25.400 line:0%
Then the thief kidnapped the bride,

00:41:25.680 --> 00:41:27.110 line:0%
and that's when I gave chase.

00:41:27.110 --> 00:41:29.510 line:0%
Still trying to weasel your way out of this?

00:41:29.720 --> 00:41:31.120 line:0%
So what happened after you chased them?

00:41:31.120 --> 00:41:32.450 line:0%
What did you see? Speak.

00:41:32.620 --> 00:41:34.600 line:0%
I don't know how far I chased them.

00:41:34.680 --> 00:41:35.480 line:0%
And then...

00:41:36.080 --> 00:41:36.880 line:0%
Then I saw

00:41:36.880 --> 00:41:38.200 line:0%
a shadowy figure with a knife.

00:41:38.200 --> 00:41:39.480 line:0%
The person who kidnapped Lady Du

00:41:39.480 --> 00:41:40.940 line:0%
had fallen nearby.

00:41:41.240 --> 00:41:42.480 line:0%
As a mere scholar,

00:41:42.500 --> 00:41:43.960 line:0%
I'm weak as a kitten.

00:41:43.980 --> 00:41:45.840 line:0%
I wouldn't dare to confront them.

00:41:46.720 --> 00:41:48.140 line:0%
So I turned and ran,

00:41:48.170 --> 00:41:49.720 line:0%
until I encountered you, My Lords,

00:41:49.720 --> 00:41:51.420 line:0%
only then was my life spared.

00:42:01.600 --> 00:42:02.400 line:0%
My Lord,

00:42:02.960 --> 00:42:04.230 line:0%
what are you doing?

00:42:04.250 --> 00:42:06.740 line:0%
Men and women should not have physical contact.

00:42:06.740 --> 00:42:09.160 line:0%
The embroidery on your clothes, Mr. Xu,

00:42:09.180 --> 00:42:10.620 line:0%
is truly exquisite.

00:42:10.890 --> 00:42:13.150 line:0%
The peach blossom pattern on the collar,

00:42:13.400 --> 00:42:15.440 line:0%
I wonder which young lady

00:42:15.440 --> 00:42:16.640 line:0%
embroidered it for you?